                <pb facs="0577" n="491" xml:id="pg491"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The only record of the substance of this meeting that has been found is a summary
                    of conversation between Stettinius and Churchill in Stettinius, <ref
                        target="#pg60">pp. 60</ref>–<ref target="#pg62">62</ref>. The meeting was “a
                    large formal dinner at Government House” given by the Governor and Commander in
                    Chief of Malta, Lieutenant General Schreiber, in honor of the American and
                    British Delegations. The information given here with respect to the meeting and
                    the participants is taken from Stettinius, <ref target="#pg56">pp. 56</ref>,
                        <ref target="#pg60">60</ref>, <ref target="#pg62">62</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
